# custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: ハイッ！<br>冒険者殿でありますな！<br>小生に何用でありますか！
#. de: <if $gn4>Eine Abenteurerin<else>Ein Abenteurer</if>! Was kann meine Wenigkeit für dich tun?
#. fr: Aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>! En quoi puis-je vous aider<nbsp>?
#. macro: <if $gn4>Ma'am<else>Sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_AHTMHAS_000_000:1"
msgid "Adventurer! <if $gn4>Ma'am<else>Sir</if>! How might I be of service?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ハイッ！<br>小生はこの拠点の警備にあたっております！
#. de: Ich wurde als Wache dieses Stützpunktes eingeteilt.
#. fr: Moi<nbsp>? Je m'occupe de la sécurité dans cette base.
#. macro: <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_AHTMHAS_000_010:1"
msgid "Me, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>? I am charged with security of this base, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 昨年配属されてきたばかりの若輩者でありますが、<br>この拠点を守るため、粉骨砕身！<br>力の限り戦うであります！
#. de: Ich bin zwar erst letztes Jahr dazugekommen, aber ich würde trotzdem alles geben, um das Camp zu verteidigen. Ich kämpfe bis zum Umfallen!
#. fr: Je suis à ce poste depuis un an seulement, mais je suis prêt à donner ma vie pour protéger le camp de la vallée du Crâne !
#. macro: <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_AHTMHAS_000_011:1"
msgid "It has been but a year since I took up this post, but I mean to defend Skull Valley with my life, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ハイッ！　ここは対サハギン族の防衛拠点であります！<br>もともと小競り合いを繰り返しておりましたが、<br>近年奴らの動きが活発なのであります！
#. de: Das hier ist ein Abwehrstützpunkt im Kampf gegen die Sahagin. Reibereien mit diesen Ungetümen gibt es zwar schon lange, aber seit einiger Zeit scheinen sie so richtig aufzudrehen.
#. fr: Laissez-moi vous expliquer. Ce camp a été construit pour repousser les assauts des Sahuagins. Même s'il ne s'agissait au départ que de simples escarmouches, nous avons désormais affaire à beaucoup plus de troupes à chaque attaque.
#. macro: <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_AHTMHAS_000_020:1"
msgid "Allow me to explain, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>! Skull Valley is an encampment established for the purpose of protecting against Sahagin incursions. Though early contact with the fishbacks resulted in only small-scale skirmishes, they have begun moving against us in greater numbers."
msgstr ""

#. ja: そのため、施設の規模を拡大し、<br>黒渦団の一大軍事拠点として強化したのであります！
#. de: Der Mahlstrom musste natürlich reagieren und die Truppenzahl erhöhen, um nicht einfach überrannt zu werden. 
#. fr: Nous avons donc dû agrandir et renforcer les ins<shy>tal<shy>la<shy>tions du camp pour permettre à davantage de forces du Maelstrom de résider ici.
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_AHTMHAS_000_021:1"
msgid "Thus, the facilities here were expanded and reinforced to accommodate a larger Maelstrom presence."
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンプ・スカルバレーのため、<br>ひいてはリムサ・ロミンサのため！<br>冒険者殿にもご助力願いたいであります！
#. de: Willst du dich uns nicht anschließen? Für Camp Schädeltal! Nein, für ganz Limsa Lominsa!
#. fr: Ce serait formidable si vous pouviez nous aider à effectuer les nombreuses tâches qui permettent à la vallée du Crâne et à tout Limsa Lominsa de résister à la menace des Sahuagins.
#. macro: <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_AHTMHAS_000_022:1"
msgid "It would be an honor to have you assist in the many duties that must be performed in order to keep Skull Valley─and perforce, Limsa Lominsa─safe from the Sahagin threat, <if $gn4>ma'am<else>sir</if>!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 何を聞く？
#. de: Was möchtest du wissen?
#. fr: Que voulez-vous savoir<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "What will you ask?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あなたのことを教えてほしい
#. de: Was machst du hier?
#. fr: Que faites-vous ici<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "What do you do here?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ここはどんなところだ？
#. de: Was hat es mit diesem Ort auf sich?
#. fr: Quel est cet endroit<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "What kind of place is this?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: キャンセル
#. de: Nichts.
#. fr: Rien en particulier
msgctxt "custom/001/RegSeaCampSkullValley_00119:TEXT_REGSEACAMPSKULLVALLEY_00119_A1_000_003:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""
